From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: incari-client <335801235+incari-client@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 12:09:08 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] skins: Skin and player-head textures download through the
 platform

The browser build has no URLConnection, so every texture a profile
names (custom heads such as Slimefun's items, players' Mojang skins
and capes) failed and stayed the default.

Signed-off-by: incari-client <335801235+incari-client@users.noreply.github.com>

diff --git a/src/main/java/net/minecraft/client/renderer/texture/SkinTextureDownloader.java b/src/main/java/net/minecraft/client/renderer/texture/SkinTextureDownloader.java
index bfd934b88617d08a7e7378fdf294a93a4ac4b858..b7a12d99b21b55987bef6232f39d34a250aec672 100644
--- a/src/main/java/net/minecraft/client/renderer/texture/SkinTextureDownloader.java
+++ b/src/main/java/net/minecraft/client/renderer/texture/SkinTextureDownloader.java
@@ -43,3 +43,5 @@
             try {
-                loadedSkin = this.downloadSkin(localCopy, texture.url());
+                // Incari start: fetched through the platform (the browser build has no URLConnection)
+                loadedSkin = incari.client.skins.SkinDownloads.read(localCopy, texture.url());
+                // Incari end
             } catch (IOException e) {
